      "common:shortName": [],
      "common:generalComment": [
        {
          "#text": "Scrapping nickel is beneficial for the environment and profitable due to current Nickel Scrap Prices. Nickel is often found in stainless steel equipment, cutlery, silverware, dental instruments, vehicle exhaust systems, pipes, valves, and other tools. The Scrap Nickel Melt Value Calculator can determine the total nickel value of scrap nickel items. The nickel value is calculated based on the actual nickel content, not including any other metals used if the nickel is an alloy.",
          "@xml:lang": "en"
        },
        {
          "#text": "由于目前的废镍价格，报废镍对环境有益，而且有利可图。镍通常存在于不锈钢设备、餐具、银器、牙科器械、汽车排气系统、管道、阀门和其他工具中。废镍熔炼价值计算器可以确定废镍物品的镍总价值。镍值根据实际镍含量计算，如果镍是合金，则不包括使用的任何其他金属。",
          "@xml:lang": "zh"
        }
      ],
